{"server":"en","storyId":"main_2_level_main_02-07_beg","groupId":"main_2","stageId":"main_02-07","title":"A Matter of Public Health","storyCode":"2-7","avgTag":"Before Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-07_beg.txt","sourceHash":"a535a9b438b393dbd4aab56b6f0bd040c9f9578077a0647e8fcf1b54825e6456","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十九关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_b"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"Nngh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"What's wrong with her...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"It's an acute symptom of Oripathy!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"But it's only been a week...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"There's also an acute form of Oripathy?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"Franka, which type is yours?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"What, are you concerned about me?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya, if Franka passes away, I hope that Rhodes Island will cremate her."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"Hey!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"That's mean, Liskarm!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"You're the one who's always talking about passing the infection on to me!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Aha... Ahaha...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"The difference between the acute and chronic types is a rather complicated topic."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"However, Misha's condition is very dangerous."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"If we don't do anything, this condition will become life threatening very quickly."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"All we can do is give her some emergency treatment..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"But we must control Misha's symptoms as quickly as possible."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"We have to make this clear to Lungmen. After this ends, we have to bring Misha with us back to Rhodes Island."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"This is part of our responsibility."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"Um..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"Is she... going to explode soon?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"Oww! That hurt! Why'd you hit me..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"Watch your mouth."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"Ughh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"If I'm going to explode one day, I'll make sure to crawl up to you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm sorry! Miss Franka, please forgive me for everything I've done!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"Pfft..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"Let's transfer her to a safe place first."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"By the way, we seem to have a situation behind us."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Infected","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"What are you doing? ! Get out! !"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"We're all fellow Infected here, don't make us resort to violence! Get out of our way!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Infected","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"You've already destroyed our home, and now you're trying to get the L.G.D. here?! Forget it! !"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Infected","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"You little...! You ignorant fool, get out of the way! !"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Infected","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Argh!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Infected","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Now you've done it!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"(Are we going to step in?)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"(We seem to have finally lost them. But if we intervene now, we're going to be exposed.)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"(Is this going to get in the way of our mission? If so, how serious are the consequences going to be?)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"(Of course this is going to interfere, but...)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"(It won't be that serious, right?)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Let's do it, then."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Rhodes Island's unequivocal mission to save the Infected, as long as the situation permits."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"Mmhm, good."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"I knew following you was the right decision."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"What do you mean by that, Miss Franka?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't worry, don't worry! I was just complimenting you!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"She probably thinks that she can get along well with you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"How do you know me so well?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"Probably because you're so annoying?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Ugh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"It's time to teach these thugs a lesson."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Yes."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Be careful of the enemies who can jump between buildings."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"In addition, make sure to protect Lungmen's Infected civilians!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"That's asking for a lot."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"--But, I'll handle it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"All right, let's go!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr. {@nickname}, make sure to lead me and Texas well!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["Amiya"]},{"speakerId":"char_012_misa","aliases":["Misha"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["Texas"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["Exusiai"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["Franka"]},{"speakerId":"char_107_liskam","aliases":["Liskarm"]}]}
